Original XFOIL provenance
------------------------
The following files are part of the original XFOIL provenance and come from
the XFOIL 6.99 distribution. They are kept unmodified and keep their own
notices:

  fortran-src/          original XFOIL 6.99 Fortran reference sources
  fortran-bin/xfoil     reference binary built from fortran-src/
  fortran-src/osmap.dat active Orr-Sommerfeld database (REAL*4)

Active and inactive OSMAP artifacts
-----------------------------------
The active, canonical XFOIL 6.99 runtime path used by this project is:

  fortran-src/osmap.f  +  fortran-src/osmap.dat

The following files are inactive original artifacts of the same XFOIL 6.99
distribution (the native-precision Orr-Sommerfeld toolchain variant). They
are preserved as upstream originals and are covered by the integrity
inventory fortran-src/SHA256SUMS, but they are NOT part of the active
numerical path: they are never compiled, linked, or used as a runtime
database by this project.

  fortran-src/osmap_DP.f   inactive original artifact (not built)
  fortran-src/osmapDP.dat  inactive original database (not loaded)

Sample profiles
---------------
sample/CLARK_Y.dat and sample/NACA2312.dat are example airfoil coordinate
files provided by the project owner. They are not part of the XFOIL 6.99
upstream distribution. See sample/README.md for their provenance and use.

